{"id":"547330c19863e2e8","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-consistency-addable.md","title":"Consistency Addable","display":"thm-consistency-addable — Consistency Addable","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-consistency-addable","aliases":["92-thm-consistency-addable"],"display":"thm-consistency-addable — Consistency Addable","depends_on":["[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-thm-second-incompleteness]]","[[92-thm-deduction-theorem]]"],"source":"第 IX 章 pp. 108–110（PDF 125–127）；添加公理的推理为本地推论","source_status":"原书第二定理的本地扩展"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-consistency-addable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-consistency-addable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-consistency-addable — Consistency Addable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"57ea3ea286817df3\" href=\"?note=57ea3ea286817df3\" title=\"92-thm-second-incompleteness\">92-thm-second-incompleteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a5543a92447a0293\" href=\"?note=a5543a92447a0293\" title=\"92-thm-deduction-theorem\">92-thm-deduction-theorem</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IX 章 pp. 108–110（PDF 125–127）；添加公理的推理为本地推论"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书第二定理的本地扩展"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span> (internal consistency sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]\">\\(G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]\\)</span> (one-axiom extension, using the constructor from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a5543a92447a0293\" href=\"?note=a5543a92447a0293\" title=\"92-thm-deduction-theorem\">92-thm-deduction-theorem</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (external consistency predicate for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}addable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land G\\nvdash\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_G\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}\\bigl(G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}addable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land G\\nvdash\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_G\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}\\bigl(G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可以添加一致性陈述作为新公理，保持一致</li>\n<li>形式系统<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>是三元组，不能作集合并；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]\">\\(G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]\\)</span>只扩张公理分量，并保留签名与规则</li>\n<li>由演绎定理，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]\">\\(G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]\\)</span>不相容当且仅当<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span></li>\n<li>因而仅有外部相容性并不足以支持任意理论；还必须排除<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>证明其内部不相容性句的否定</li>\n<li>因该系统是有限公理扩张，若它仍具标准有效证明算术化与足够强度，则它仍不完备</li>\n<li>要写“该扩张不能证明自身一致性”，必须相对于扩张系统重新构造其证明谓词和内部一致性句；不能把外部一致性谓词直接放进对象语言</li>\n<li>这是递归扩展不完备性的实例</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>保留不能证明一致性句否定的独立条件；第二不完备性只排除正侧，并不自动排除否定。由闭句演绎定理，添加该句一致恰需排除原系统证明其否定。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 IX 章 pp. 108–110（PDF 125–127）；添加公理的推理为本地推论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-second-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"57ea3ea286817df3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-second-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-deduction-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"a5543a92447a0293","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-deduction-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}_G$ (internal consistency sentence, see [[92-df-consistency-statement]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-deduction-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"a5543a92447a0293","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]$ (one-axiom extension, using the constructor from [[92-thm-deduction-theorem]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}addable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land G\\nvdash\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_G\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}\\bigl(G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]","display":false},{"tex":"G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":2144,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-269","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-consistency-addable]]"}],"outgoing":["e0eabee5d77258a7","68f172d58c15e75d","c7befd96bd551ade","57ea3ea286817df3","a5543a92447a0293"]}